OL,3,GNEWSA'Predator' jailed for raping girls
OL,4,Adecades apart
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "sexual predator" who raped and
OL,7,Fabused three girls decades apart has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for 24 years.
OL,10,FMichael Burke's offending against two
OL,11,Fgirls in the 1990s came to light when a
OL,12,Fthird girl, who he abused more than 20
OL,13,Fyears later, reported it to police,
OL,14,FNewcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,16,FOne of his victims said he had "ruined
OL,17,Fher life", while Judge Carolyn Scott
OL,18,Fsaid Burke, 66, had caused "severe
OL,19,Fpsychological harm" and would be "very
OL,20,Fold" by the time he was free again.
