OL,4,Adecades apart
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe abuser, from Newcastle, had denied
OL,7,Fwrongdoing but was found guilty of
OL,8,Fmultiple offences including rape and
OL,9,Fsexual and indecent assaults of
OL,10,Fchildren.
